WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.240
fentanyl, and other drugs.

00:02.240 --> 00:04.180
Each boat that we sink carries drugs

00:04.180 --> 00:08.480
that would kill more than 25,000 Americans.

00:08.480 --> 00:11.240
We will not let that happen.

00:11.240 --> 00:13.580
Energy is another area where the United States

00:13.580 --> 00:16.140
is now thriving like never before.

00:16.140 --> 00:18.720
We're getting rid of the falsely named renewable.

